# Test coverage output (S409: build artifacts must not be tracked — a
# stale committed copy actively poisoned greps with pre-S404 renderings)
coverage/

# package-lock.json is TRACKED (audit W105 T-01). It is dependency *resolution
# metadata*, not a build artifact, so the S409 "no committed artifacts" policy
# above does not apply to it. Committing it is what makes `npm ci` possible from
# a clean clone and pins the `github:detain/*` git-deps to exact commit SHAs —
# without it every CI install is a floating resolve that a tag retag could shift.
# The lockfile MUST be regenerated (`npm install`) whenever a pin in package.json
# changes, then committed alongside it.
